# Where the browser reaches the WMS backend. Vite bakes this in at BUILD time, not run
# time, so it must be correct before `npm run build` — changing it later means rebuilding.
#
# On the warehouse PC this must be the store server's LAN address, NOT localhost.
# `localhost` resolves to whatever machine the browser is on, so a build with localhost
# only works on the server itself and every other PC in the store silently fails to load
# any data. Use the fixed LAN IP (or a hostname the store's network resolves):
#
#   VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.1.50:5100
#
# Local development only:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5100
